2  KNOWN-ANSWER CASE -- chop for 36 bars then a trend for 36. Can it find the boundary?
====================================================================================================
   true boundary at bar 36. Found: median 33, mean 32.6, within +/-4 bars on 100% of paths, no split at all on 0%
   one example segmentation:
      bars   0..32  L=32  CHOP  z=0.580 vs C=0.986  t=-0.55  gain 0.3
      bars  32..72  L=40  TREND z=6.304 vs C=0.991  t=+7.24  gain 52.4

